      "card_ids": ["C04"],
      "claim": "In rats and dogs, 14C-moexipril radioactivity was not detected in brain after systemic administration, indicating lack of BBB crossing for that molecule.",
      "evidence_role": "contradictory"
    }
  ],
  "confidence": "moderate",
  "decision_summary": "The highest-transfer direct in-vivo records show measurable brain levels and functional CNS effects after systemic administration, supporting meaningful CNS access. Lower-transfer negative records do not override this direct positive evidence.",
