    "Some positive records report low absolute brain concentrations without unbound brain exposure data.",
    "Negative records come from molecules with lower assay-transfer scores and are not directly comparable in conditions.",
    "No direct human CNS efficacy or quantitative brain uptake study is available for the query."
  ],
  "new_evidence_assessment": [],
  "revision_action": "initial"
}

